<title>NETHERLANDS: HBG sees flat earnings in 1997.</title>
<headline>HBG sees flat earnings in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>RIJSWIJK, Netherlands 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Hollandsche Beton Groep NV said on Tuesday it expected its 1997 net profit to be similar to the net profit it made in 1996.</p>
<p>Earlier today HBG reported a 1996 net profit of 111 million guilders, up from 104 million in 1995.  </p>
<p>&quot;Barring unforeseen circumstances and given, among other things, the volume and quality of the order book, worth NLG 10 billion, net profit in 1997 is expected to be similar in level to that for 1996,&quot; HBG said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
